2. Create src/main/scala/newspipe/domain/models/Enrichment.scala with exactly the content in the scala fence below.
```scala
package newspipe.domain.models

import newspipe.domain.valueObjects.{GeoArea, Urgency}

final case class Enrichment(
    summary: String,
    countries: List[String],
    geoArea: GeoArea,
    topics: List[String],
    actors: List[String],
    urgency: Urgency,
